          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{6\\sqrt3\\times8\\sqrt2}{\\sqrt{32}\\times\\sqrt{27}}&=\\frac{48\\sqrt6}{4\\sqrt2\\times3\\sqrt3}\\\\\\frac{6\\sqrt3\\times8\\sqrt2}{\\sqrt{32}\\times\\sqrt{27}}&=\\frac{48\\sqrt6}{12\\sqrt6}\\\\\\frac{6\\sqrt3\\times8\\sqrt2}{\\sqrt{32}\\times\\sqrt{27}}&=4\\end{align*}$$",
